[A] closed form on a constructed matrix: 2000 cells, selected-gene total F = 1000, full total T = 4000, rate 0.5
  correct expectation rate*T = 2000; code's expectation rate*T + rate*(1-rate)*F = 2250
  shipped: mean final total 2250.3   fixed: 2000.0

