  shipped : mean simulated total    7809.8; threshold 0.1876; called 147; recall 0.980; precision 1.000; overall_doublet_rate_ 0.1053
  fixed   : mean simulated total    7396.1; threshold 0.1701; called 146; recall 0.973; precision 1.000; overall_doublet_rate_ 0.1066
  same parents True, same thinned counts True, totals differ for 3300 of 3300 simulated doublets
