  for scale, default (no subsampling): threshold 0.1876; called 144; recall 0.960; precision 1.000

[C] scanpy port: same function, totals only stored as metadata
  adata_sim.obs['n_counts'] / X.sum(1): mean 1.2000 (all genes kept here, so F = T and the code's expected inflation factor is 1 + (1-rate) = 1.2)
  adata_sim.obs['n_counts'] / (0.8 * parents' totals): mean 1.2001
